 Ocean is Yours!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry the customers from other islands to your Resort island. Set sail across the vast, unpredictable sea. Will you return rich\u2026 or not at all?<br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727330/extras/9a25c06e2bed2112492c1c0677a4c744.poster.avif?t=1760363785\" width=615 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727330/extras/9a25c06e2bed2112492c1c0677a4c744.webm?t=1760363785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tips &amp; Tricks </strong><br>  <br><strong>Resort Rating:</strong> Upgrade furniture &amp; decorations to increase Resort Rating. A higher rating means higher payments from customers!   <br>  <br><strong>Resort Popularity:</strong> Deliver top-tier service and keep customers happy to boost your popularity. More popularity = more customers!   <br>  <br><strong>Survival:</strong> Stay fed, stay hydrated, stay alive. Water wells are free, and fishing is your best bet for a cheap meal!</p>","developers":["Tenjin Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3613960","name":"Resort Island Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727330/888068ee5bbda30106af6635d5d8eca68d75c927/header.jpg?t=1760363785","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"htt